# Paths excluded from VS IDE Bridge best-practice (BPxxxx) analysis.
#
# Only advisory best-practice coaching is filtered by this file. Compiler and
# language-server errors and warnings are never affected, so nothing listed here
# can hide a real defect - only a refactor suggestion.
#
# Syntax is the gitignore subset: '#' comments, '*'/'?' inside one path segment,
# '**' across segments, a trailing '/' for a whole directory, a leading '/' to
# anchor at this file's directory, and '!' to re-include. The LAST matching
# pattern wins, so the '!' lines below must stay after the trees they carve into.

# --- Code inherited from PrusaSlicer / Slic3r -------------------------------
# This is a fork. Flattening nesting or renaming locals in inherited files
# conflicts with every upstream merge, so BP rows here are noise rather than
# work this repository can act on.
/src/libslic3r/
/src/slic3r/
/src/platform/
/src/test-utils/
/src/occt_wrapper/
/tests/

# --- Fork-owned code BP should still cover ---------------------------------
# Added by this repository rather than inherited, so the coaching applies.
!/src/slic3r/GUI/CreateMMUTiledCanvas.cpp
!/src/slic3r/GUI/ThemeMetrics.cpp
!/src/slic3r/GUI/Calibration*.cpp
!/src/slic3r/GUI/Calibration*.hpp
!/tests/automation/
